[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   highest- and lowest-level entry point; there is no convenience wrapper hiding
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   a lower layer, and no internal helper with external linkage (`nm -D` shows
